This Status Command reflects changes on vacuum width.

Syntax: VW VacuumTill, VacuumFrom;

VacuumTill: Left side of vacuum area in plotter units [0.01 mm].
VacuumFrom: Right side of vacuum area in plotter units [0.01 mm].

Example: VW 123400,-4000;
Vacuum area set from 0 mm to 1234 mm.

